      "statement": "The app runs unsandboxed (com.apple.security.app-sandbox = false) with only network-client and audio-input entitlements plus a ScreenCaptureKit picker mach-lookup exception, which is what makes global event taps, synthetic events and arbitrary user-chosen endpoints possible.",
