      "statement": "Builds use the elfhub scheme from Xcode; terminal xcodebuild must not be used for development or testing because it invalidates TCC permission grants and forces Screen Recording/Accessibility to be re-requested, and the known Swift 6 concurrency and deprecated onChange warnings are non-blocking and not to be fixed.",
